<title>USA: U.S. debt futures down, but off lows on Beige Book.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures down, but off lows on Beige Book.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 7 - U.S. debt futures were down, but off session lows after the Fed's Beige Book was released. June T-bonds climbed to 109-15/32 after falling to 109-08/32 on the 10-year note auction. The book said U.S. wage, retail price pressures generally subdued.</p>
